  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "Note",
   "pos": [
    80,
    270
   ],
   "size": [
    315,
    80
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 1,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Testing-only workflow for the sweep harness; hidden from the template browser. Based on dgx-monarch-ltx25-i2v-guide, with only the changes needed for this test. This graph puts a mask on Add Guide, so the guide frame steers only part of the picture. The second Load Image names the mask picture and Convert Image to Mask reads its red channel: white keeps the guide, black lets the model invent. A mask, or any strength under 1.0, turns on the per guide attention bias the base graph leaves off at strength 1.0; uly2 re-expresses that bias and ring refuses it. The media widgets name the synthetic files benchmark/sweep/media.py writes into comfy's input folder. The guide and the mask are that pair, one soft shape on each, so a wrong mask shows up as a wrong picture rather than as nothing at all."
   ],
   "title": "DGX Monarch | LTX 2.5 guide with a spatial mask"
  },
